<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Give up thy will to Jesus,</l><l>And trust Him though He slay;</l><l>Hush all thy fears and questions,</l><l>And settle it today.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>O soul so tossed with tempest,</l><l>Upon His promise stay;</l><l>Cast out faith’s strong sheet anchor,</l><l>And settle it today.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Lord, I give up the struggle,</l><l>To Thee commit my way;</l><l>I trust Thy word forever,</l><l>And settle it today.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
